# Project Structure

Flutter monorepo managed by Melos.

## Ownership

- `apps/multichoice` — main app (`apps/showcase` ignored by Melos)
- `packages/core` — blocs, services, repositories, controllers, wrappers
- `packages/models` — DTOs, DB models, enums, mappers
- `packages/theme` — theme extensions and colors
- `packages/ui_kit` — reusable widgets and UI constants
- `functions`, `docs`, `designs` — support areas

## Boundaries

- App UI → `apps/multichoice/lib/presentation`, `layouts`, `app`, `utils`
- Business logic → `packages/core`, not presentation
- Shared models → `packages/models` only
- Shared styling/widgets → `packages/theme` or `packages/ui_kit`
- Use `export.dart` barrels where the package already does
